stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> created
  created --> validating: start
  validating --> running: healthy resources
  validating --> failed: validation failure
  running --> pausing: pause
  pausing --> paused: in-flight IDs finished; remainder released
  running --> stopping: stop / deadline / no-workers / condition
  pausing --> stopping: stop
  paused --> stopping: stop
  stopping --> stopped: current authority cancelled
  paused --> running: resume; new run_id
  stopped --> running: resume; new run_id
  failed --> validating: resume; new run_id
  running --> completed: effective range exhausted; no gaps
  completed --> stopped: explicit retry of selected failures
  completed --> [*]
